an API key (create one in the ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev","children":"Developer Center"}],"; keys are prefixed"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"cd-k","children":"anm_mkt_"}],") or a signed-in browser session. Create the function shell:"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codewrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codetitle mono","children":"create the function"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"cd-code","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"curl -s https://animica.dev/api/cloud/v1/functions \\\n  -H \"authorization: Bearer $ANM_KEY\" \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"slug\": \"hello\", \"name\": \"Hello\", \"timeoutMs\": 10000, \"memoryMb\": 128}'\n# -> { \"function\": { \"id\": \"…\", \"slug\": \"hello\", \"status\": \"DRAFT\", … } }"}]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. Deploy it"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Pushing source creates ",["$","b",null,{"children":"version 1"}]," — an immutable snapshot — and drives the full pipeline: static validation (AST-only, never executes your code) → canonical artifact hashes → DA blob → on-chain anchor DEPLOY tx → ",["$","code",null,{"className":"cd-k","children":"ACTIVE"}],"."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codewrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codetitle mono","children":"deploy version 1"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"cd-code","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"curl -s https://animica.dev/api/cloud/v1/functions/$FUNCTION_ID/versions \\\n  -H \"authorization: Bearer $ANM_KEY\" \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n  -d \"$(python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nprint(json.dumps({\"source\": open(\"handler.py\").read(), \"entrypoint\": \"main\"}))\nPY\n)\"\n# -> validates, snapshots version 1, stores the DA blob, broadcasts the\n#    on-chain anchor DEPLOY tx, and activates the endpoint"}]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Call it — and share the link"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Every deployed function is served at"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"cd-k","children":"/api/cloud/v1/fn/{owner}/{slug}"}],". Public functions with no surcharge can be called by anyone inside the free tier (",50,"/day per caller); priced or private functions require a key. Every response carries the execution's request id and exact cost."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codewrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"cd-codetitle mono","children":"invoke"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"cd-code","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"curl -s https://animica.dev/api/cloud/v1/fn/<you>/hello \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"name\": \"Ada\"}'\n# -> {\"greeting\": \"Hello, Ada!\", \"echo\": {\"name\": \"Ada\"}}\n#    response headers: x-animica-request-id, x-animica-cost-nanm, x-animica-status"}]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What you get per call"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Metered billing"}],": base fee + CPU-ms + memory + AI tokens + egress, integer nANM —"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs/cloud/pricing","children":"Pricing & economics"}],"."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Your split, settled instantly"}],": the caller's payment is divided exactly (price = platform fee + your share) in one ledger transaction —"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs/cloud/earnings","children":"Wallets & earnings"}],"."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"A receipt"}]," with request id, usage and the full money breakdown."]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Limits that apply to every function"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["Source ≤ ",256," KB · timeout ",1,"s–",300,"s (default ",30,"s) · memory ",64,"–",1024," MB (default ",256," MB)"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Request body ≤ ",512," KB · response ≤"," ",1024," KB · ",500," log lines/run"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Nested calls: depth ≤ ",4,", ≤ ",16," calls/run · AI: ≤"," ",8," calls and ≤ ",8192," tokens/run"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"childr